<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
  <!-- Column 1 -->
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-(--n200) bg-(--background) p-6">
    <div class="mb-3 text-2xl">⚠️</div>
    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-(--body) mb-2">Deprecation</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-(--n800) leading-relaxed">
      We document features that we will remove in future versions. When migrating to a new version, check <a href="#deprecated" class="text-(--p300) underline">deprecated features</a> and replace them with the successor API or feature.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 -->
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-(--n200) bg-(--background) p-6">
    <div class="mb-3 text-2xl">🗑️</div>
    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-(--body) mb-2">Removal</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-(--n800) leading-relaxed">
      We document Public API that we will remove in future versions in the <code class="bg-(--n75) px-1 rounded">@deprecated</code> tag. Features and Public API features will be removed on the mentioned versions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 -->
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-(--n200) bg-(--background) p-6">
    <div class="mb-3 text-2xl">🎯</div>
    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-(--body) mb-2">Problem View as Warnings</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-(--n800) leading-relaxed">
      In Designers UI in the Problem View we warn you about usages of features. Keep in mind that older projects may have many warnings. They don't block your workflow.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
